  "published": "2026-11-13T15:51:37.757Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.0.0: .NET 11 / C# 15 support, multi-targeting net10.0 and net11.0, IsTrimmable/IsAotCompatible verified, EnablePreviewFeatures for latest C# constructs, hardware intrinsics, tiered compilation. 2.1.x: fixes selector validation and index isolation, form-state matching, meta charset detection, SVG/MathML raw-text handling, DOM root tracking when moving nodes, and ToPlainText() on preformatted or skipped elements. See https://github.com/Nkkinsoft/NkkinParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md.",
